Training fixes for topaz-em 0.3.20, from tbepler/topaz master (no release yet):
  c82fec95 Worked init fxn for dataset and images
  9029e08f Correct num pixels given radius in 2D case (stats.py only)
  fc28858b Fix KDTree query order to distance,idx
  67cecc23 Added missing worker init fn call
Without these, --num-workers > 0 repeats batches (upstream issue #260),
negative crops can land on particles, and --num-particles gives a pi too large
by a factor of 2*radius+1 in 2D.

